 "completed": 0, "percent_completed": 0}, "issue_dependencies_summary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "\r\nI am receiving ByteArrays of RTCM Data from a service provider and I want to forward this data to the Flight Controller.\r\nI used the similar code to the below example: \r\n` \r\nval rtcmEncodedString: String = Base64.encodeToString(buffer, Base64.NO_WRAP)\r\n\r\nval rtkData = Rtk.RtcmData(rtcmEncodedString)\r\nval completable = rtk.sendRtcmData(rtkData)\r\nLog.d(\"rtk\", \"Rtk Data: ${rtkData.data}\")\r\ncompletable.subscribe ({\r\n    Log.d(\"rtk\", \"Forward RTK data completed\")\r\n}, { e ->\r\n    Log.d(\"rtk\", \"Error: ${e.message}\")\r\n})`\r\n\r\nMy RTCM Data coming from an NTRIP Source.\r\nFor testing, I am still seeing GpsInfo showing 3D Locked instead of RTK, any help would be appreciated. Thanks!", "closed_by": {"login": "Ba0Nguyen", "id": 161372304, "node_id": "U_kgDOCZ5YkA", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/161372304?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/Ba0Nguyen", "html_url": "https://github.com/Ba0Nguyen", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Ba0Nguyen/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Ba0Nguyen/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Ba0Nguyen/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Ba0Nguyen/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Ba0Nguyen/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Ba0Nguyen/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Ba0Nguyen/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Ba0Nguyen/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/Ba0Nguyen/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/mavlink/MAVSDK/issues/2352/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0